                <li>This project: <a href="https://burckhardt.name/presentations/erna-magnus-collection/" target="_blank">Slides</a> [in German]</li>
                <li>The data set: <a href="./data/erna-magnus-a-z-normalized.ndjson">erna-magnus-a-z-normalized.ndjson</a> [Newline Delimited JSON]
                <li>The code for this Web-Site: <a href="https://github.com/burki/erna-magnus-collection" target="_blank">github.com/burki/erna-magnus-collection</a></li>
